<title>USA: NYCE certificated cotton stocks rise to 169,352.</title>
<headline>NYCE certificated cotton stocks rise to 169,352.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of June 25 totaled 169,352 bales, up from 169,267 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 339 bales issued, 254 cancellations, 8,386 decertification orders, and no bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
